Among the paid channels with at least one last-touch closed-won deal in 2025, Webinars had the lowest last-touch CPA at about $1,263. That is 750,000 in spend over 594 closed-won deals.

Connected TV is excluded because it had no last-touch closed-won deals in 2025. Paid Search Brand was next lowest at about $1,418, and Affiliates and Partners followed at about $1,442.

