I can't answer this with the tools I have. True incremental CPA for Connected TV would need incremental conversions from the marketing mix model (MMM). The governed metrics don't include the MMM. The only CPA available is last-touch (spend divided by closed-won deals credited to the channel). That isn't incremental, and CTV is often under-credited in last-touch data. I haven't estimated an incremental figure.

I can pull the last-touch CTV CPA for 2025 if that would help, but it would answer a different question.

