Gross margin can't be answered with the governed metrics. The defined metrics cover marketing spend, leads, pipeline and closed-won revenue (first-year contract value). None of them includes cost of goods sold, cost of revenue or any other cost data, and I have no definition of gross margin to work from. Any figure I gave would be an estimate, so I'm not providing one.

You'd need to get this from finance, or have a COGS or gross margin metric added to the governed set.

